      "writtenOn": "2019-02-07T03:59:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The transparent case creates both OLT and ONU flows here. In my opinion it should only create the OLT flow (parent_device_flow) here, and create the ONU flow in the previous check for Table 0.",
      "revId": "70a4814491cd73a01e3a8bfe5afe1cc31c812b6a",
